# Never commit credentials. The Supabase publishable key in js/portal.js is
# safe and belongs in the repository: it identifies the project and grants
# nothing on its own, because every table has row-level security.
#
# These are NOT safe and must never appear here:
#   the Supabase service_role key
#   the Resend API key
#   any Google Workspace password or app password
# They live in Supabase settings and in the password manager.
